{
"#name"
:
{
"sd"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"为 sd 设计的增强模块"
,
"en"
:
"Enhanced modules for sd"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"sd（search & displace）是一种查找和替换文本工具，使用常见的正则表达式语法，类似于 sed，但专注于替换操作，从而使用起来更直观、更易读。\n该模块主要通过 fzf 以交互方式预览结果，并展示上下文中的差异，同时增加了免安装直接使用的功能。\n"
,
"en"
:
"sd (search & displace) is a text search and replace tool that uses common regular expression syntax, similar to sed, but focuses on replacement operations, making it more intuitive and readable.\nThis module mainly uses fzf to interactively preview results and show differences in context, while adding the ability to use it directly without installation.\n"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"cat test | x sd"
,
"cn"
:
"使用 fzf 为 sd 提供交互式 APP 查找和替换文本"
,
"en"
:
"Use fzf to provide an interactive app for finding and replacing text in sd."
}
]
,
"#subcmd:Enhance"
:
[
"--fzfapp"
,
"--cmd"
]
,
"--fzfapp"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"使用 fzf 为 sd 提供交互式 APP"
,
"en"
:
"Using fzf to provide an interactive app for sd"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"file"
,
"cn"
:
"文件"
}
,
"#exec"
:
"___x_cmd_advise__file"
}
}
,
"--cmd"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"直接运行 sd 命令"
,
"en"
:
"Run the sd command directly"
}
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-cmd-advise://sd/advise.t.jso"
}

